            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t82",
              "name": "说明",
              "content": "全球人工夜间照明面积每年\n增长约百分之二。三座城市的\n地面照度中位数十年间由\n5 lux 升至 12 lux。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$c-soft"
                }
              ],
