        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "f290",
          "name": "解读一",
          "width": 672,
          "height": "fit_content",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 24,
          "alignItems": "start",
          "fill": [],
          "x": 1120,
          "y": 432,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t289",
              "name": "解读一",
              "content": "0.5 与 1 lux 之间差异不显著；\n5 lux 起提前量增幅变陡，\n而 5 至 20 lux 正是三座城市\n住宅区道路照明的常见区间。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$c-soft"
                }
              ],
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "letterSpacing": 0,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "f292",
          "name": "解读二",
          "width": 672,
          "height": "fit_content",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 24,
          "alignItems": "start",
          "fill": [],
          "x": 1120,
          "y": 684,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "t291",
              "name": "解读二",
              "content": "把照度压到 5 lux 以下，提前量\n的中位数回到十分钟以内 ——\n这是本文唯一可操作的阈值。",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
              "fontSize": 30,
              "fontWeight": 400,
              "fill": [
                {
                  "type": "solid",
                  "color": "$c-soft"
                }
              ],
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "letterSpacing": 0,
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container"
            }
          ]
